WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.500
Pikachu!

2
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:18.566
Some Thunderbolt, Electro Ball, Quick Attack and don't forget Iron Tail.

3
00:00:18.633 --> 00:00:20.533
First-rate moves, all!

4
00:00:20.599 --> 00:00:24.233
Without a doubt, that Pikachu needs to be ours!

5
00:00:24.299 --> 00:00:27.799
Yes, but first, we need to make our job easier

6
00:00:27.866 --> 00:00:30.700
by separating Pikachu from that pesky twerp.

7
00:00:30.766 --> 00:00:32.400
Wobbu!

8
00:00:32.466 --> 00:00:35.000
Yeah, but those two are stuck together like glue!

9
00:00:35.066 --> 00:00:37.633
Prying them apart is going to be tough!

10
00:00:41.133 --> 00:00:44.133
I couldn't help hearing you.

11
00:00:44.199 --> 00:00:47.566
That Pikachu would be a most useful acquisition indeed.

12
00:00:47.633 --> 00:00:50.566
Eavesdropping is bad manners! Who are you?

13
00:00:50.633 --> 00:00:56.099
They call me Madame X and this is Malamar.

14
00:00:56.166 --> 00:01:00.933
Malamar.

15
00:01:04.966 --> 00:01:07.800
♪ I want to be the very best ♪

16
00:01:07.866 --> 00:01:11.366
♪ Like no one ever was ♪

17
00:01:11.433 --> 00:01:14.133
♪ To catch them is my real test ♪

18
00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:17.200
♪ To train them is my cause ♪

19
00:01:17.266 --> 00:01:20.300
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all It's you and me ♪

20
00:01:20.366 --> 00:01:23.566
♪ Pokémon! I know it's my destiny ♪

21
00:01:23.633 --> 00:01:26.899
♪ Pokémon! Yeah, you're my best friend ♪

22
00:01:26.966 --> 00:01:29.333
♪ In a world we must defend ♪

23
00:01:29.399 --> 00:01:31.833
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all ♪

24
00:01:31.899 --> 00:01:34.899
♪ Got to catch them all! Pokémon! ♪

25
00:01:43.899 --> 00:01:46.066
After leaving Camphrier Town,

26
00:01:46.133 --> 00:01:48.833
our heroes now continue their journey to Cyllage City

27
00:01:48.899 --> 00:01:52.166
and Ash's next Gym battle challenge.

28
00:01:52.233 --> 00:01:55.566
Let's see. In order to get to the Pokémon Centre,

29
00:01:55.633 --> 00:01:57.833
we pass through this forest.

30
00:01:57.899 --> 00:02:01.899
- Huh? Whoa! What's that?
- Pikachu!

31
00:02:01.966 --> 00:02:05.399
Oh, that, that's a radio observatory.

32
00:02:05.466 --> 00:02:07.166
Radio observatory?

33
00:02:07.233 --> 00:02:10.900
Right! It's a facility that receives radio waves from outer space!

34
00:02:10.966 --> 00:02:13.966
Then it automatically analyzes those waves,

35
00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:17.400
utilizing the latest state-of-the-art, high-technology equipment!

36
00:02:17.466 --> 00:02:20.933
I'm not sure what you're talking about, but it sounds cool!

37
00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:23.900
Pika!

38
00:02:23.966 --> 00:02:27.133
- Huh?

39
00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:30.633
Hey, you lugs, help me!

40
00:02:30.700 --> 00:02:33.633
- Meowth! What happened?
- Pika! Pika!

41
00:02:33.700 --> 00:02:37.066
Meowth's hurt! We need first aid! Bonnie!

42
00:02:37.133 --> 00:02:38.466
Okay!

43
00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:42.600
-Pika?

44
00:02:44.266 --> 00:02:47.100
- What's up?
- Huh. You're awake!

45
00:02:47.166 --> 00:02:49.066
It's a ton of twerps!

46
00:02:49.133 --> 00:02:51.299
No! You've got to rest!

47
00:02:51.366 --> 00:02:54.466
Stay down and take it easy! Here, drink this.

48
00:02:54.533 --> 00:02:57.333
huh!

49
00:02:57.400 --> 00:02:59.366
Yeah! That hit the spot!

50
00:02:59.433 --> 00:03:04.200
Ah! You lugs saved my life. I owe you big time!

51
00:03:04.266 --> 00:03:08.233
Really? If you ask me, you're just trying to trick us again.

52
00:03:08.299 --> 00:03:09.433
- Na-na!
- Pika!

53
00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:14.200
Me? Perish the thought! I'm on the level, no doubt!

54
00:03:14.266 --> 00:03:16.833
I came all this way to tell you you're in danger!

55
00:03:16.899 --> 00:03:19.200
Danger? What are you talking about?

56
00:03:19.266 --> 00:03:22.500
- Yeah. I want to hear more.
- Pika, pika.

57
00:03:22.566 --> 00:03:25.866
Just thinking back on everything that happened gives me the creeps.

58
00:03:25.933 --> 00:03:28.833
It was like the worst nightmare anybody could have!

59
00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:32.299
Malamar.

60
00:03:33.733 --> 00:03:36.799
From this point on, you are all my servants

61
00:03:36.866 --> 00:03:39.799
and you will obey my every command.

62
00:03:42.233 --> 00:03:46.200
I don't know who you think you are, but we don't take orders from pushy big mouths!

63
00:03:46.266 --> 00:03:50.299
There's only one boss who's our boss and that's the one and only boss!

64
00:03:50.366 --> 00:03:51.433
Wobbu!

65
00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:54.100
Inkay, Psybeam!

66
00:03:54.166 --> 00:03:56.166
Pumpkaboo! Shadow Ball!

67
00:04:05.666 --> 00:04:09.200
- Inkay, you okay?
- Pumpkaboo, attack those fools!

68
00:04:09.266 --> 00:04:12.633
Forget about it! Those two won't attack my Malamar

69
00:04:12.700 --> 00:04:15.200
and they won't attack me, Madame X, either!

70
00:04:15.266 --> 00:04:21.033
Malamar.

71
00:04:23.166 --> 00:04:27.866
This is bad! That wacko's going to take control over all of us!

72
00:04:27.933 --> 00:04:29.900
All right!

73
00:04:36.833 --> 00:04:38.733
Inflicting pain upon yourself

74
00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:42.266
in order to maintain control over your own mind is quite clever.

75
00:04:42.333 --> 00:04:44.000
Grab it!

76
00:04:45.333 --> 00:04:48.466
- Yes, Madame.
- No! Fight it!

77
00:04:48.533 --> 00:04:51.233
Snap out of it! You've got to wake up, quick!

78
00:04:51.300 --> 00:04:53.166
I'm out of here!

79
00:04:53.233 --> 00:04:55.333
-After Meowth!

80
00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:57.466
- Yes, Madame.
- Wobbu!

81
00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:05.066
So I ran and ran as fast as I could.

82
00:05:05.133 --> 00:05:08.566
I never thought I'd get a load of someone so creepy and kooky.

83
00:05:08.633 --> 00:05:11.733
We can't just stand here yapping!

84
00:05:11.800 --> 00:05:16.500
Madame X is coming to get her hooks in Pikachu next! You'd better scram!

85
00:05:16.566 --> 00:05:19.500
Blah-blah! I still think you're trying to trick us,

86
00:05:19.566 --> 00:05:22.800
so you can end up catching Pikachu for yourself!

87
00:05:22.866 --> 00:05:26.066
Bonnie's right, but you won't fool us this time!

88
00:05:26.133 --> 00:05:29.466
Huh? No way! This is strictly on the level!

89
00:05:29.533 --> 00:05:31.599
Come on! Take a look in these peepers

90
00:05:31.666 --> 00:05:34.066
and you'll see I'm as honest as the day is long!

91
00:05:36.066 --> 00:05:39.200
Meowth, what are you doing here?

92
00:05:39.266 --> 00:05:41.666
- Tell me.
- You'd better hurry and catch Pikachu.

93
00:05:41.733 --> 00:05:44.200
- Team Rocket!
- Pika!

94
00:05:44.266 --> 00:05:46.966
So you are trying to catch Pikachu after all!

95
00:05:47.033 --> 00:05:49.166
No! You've got it all wrong, pally!

96
00:05:49.233 --> 00:05:52.666
They're being controlled. Look at their dopey eyes!

97
00:05:52.733 --> 00:05:55.133
-Let's move!

98
00:05:55.200 --> 00:06:00.400
-It's them and that's Madame X!

99
00:06:00.466 --> 00:06:04.700
- What kind of a name is X?
- So that's Malamar! Let's see.

100
00:06:04.766 --> 00:06:08.866
Malamar, the Overturning Pokémon and the evolved form of Inkay.

101
00:06:08.933 --> 00:06:11.733
Possessing the strongest hypnotic powers of any Pokémon,

102
00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:15.599
Malamar can compel others to do anything it wants them to do.

103
00:06:15.666 --> 00:06:20.366
So that's the famous Pikachu, a strong-looking Pokémon, indeed.

104
00:06:20.433 --> 00:06:21.566
Pika.

105
00:06:21.633 --> 00:06:25.299
I think I'll make you my servant right here and now. Malamar!

106
00:06:25.366 --> 00:06:27.766
Malamar!

107
00:06:27.833 --> 00:06:31.266
Keep your eyes off of that light! It'll grab you by the brain!

108
00:06:31.333 --> 00:06:33.233
Pikachu, stop them with Electro Ball!

109
00:06:33.299 --> 00:06:36.966
Pika! Pikachu!

110
00:06:38.299 --> 00:06:40.333
Scram while the scramming's good!

111
00:06:42.466 --> 00:06:44.099
Leaving so soon?

112
00:06:44.166 --> 00:06:47.599
Pikachu will now become a member of our Pokémon patrol.

113
00:06:47.666 --> 00:06:49.233
Pokémon patrol?

114
00:06:49.299 --> 00:06:52.666
Unstoppable, and destined to take over the world

115
00:06:52.733 --> 00:06:56.099
and put our beloved Madame X on the throne to rule it all.

116
00:06:56.166 --> 00:06:58.500
Wobbuff!

117
00:06:58.566 --> 00:07:01.633
There is no way we're going to let you take over the world!

118
00:07:01.700 --> 00:07:06.266
Ah! Using Pikachu to take over the world is just plain wrong!

119
00:07:06.333 --> 00:07:08.933
You're nuts! Huh?

120
00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:12.533
Of course, now that I think of it, that's what we're always trying to do.

121
00:07:12.599 --> 00:07:15.033
Hmm.

122
00:07:15.099 --> 00:07:17.799
Pika!

123
00:07:17.866 --> 00:07:19.866
Pika! Pi!

124
00:07:20.866 --> 00:07:25.299
- Now they're using Malamar's Psychic!
- Huh?

125
00:07:25.366 --> 00:07:27.366
Farewell, fools!

126
00:07:30.833 --> 00:07:36.833
- Unh! Stop! Pikachu!
- We've got to do something!!

127
00:07:36.900 --> 00:07:40.266
I know, but how do we know where they're taking Pikachu?

128
00:07:40.333 --> 00:07:43.066
I'm sure Madame X has to have a hideout somewhere!

129
00:07:43.133 --> 00:07:47.299
The future is now, thanks to science!

130
00:07:47.366 --> 00:07:49.299
Clemontic Gear on!

131
00:07:49.366 --> 00:07:53.299
I thought we'd encounter a situation precisely like this one!

132
00:07:53.366 --> 00:07:56.799
- You did?
- Awesome!

133
00:07:57.799 --> 00:07:59.599
It's a Pikabot!

134
00:07:59.666 --> 00:08:02.866
I call it my Automatic Pikachu Retrieval Device!

135
00:08:02.933 --> 00:08:04.200
So cool!

136
00:08:04.266 --> 00:08:06.266
Pikachu Retrieval Device?

137
00:08:06.333 --> 00:08:08.866
- You get no points for good names.
- Na-na!

138
00:08:08.933 --> 00:08:11.933
Observe! This detects Pikachu's unique energy pattern

139
00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:14.533
and will track it to the farthest reaches of the land,

140
00:08:14.599 --> 00:08:17.366
the bottom of the ocean, or the expanse of the sky!

141
00:08:17.433 --> 00:08:19.866
Great! Now we'll find Pikachu for sure!

142
00:08:19.933 --> 00:08:25.000
It's incredibly inspiring that the steady progress of science can never be stopped!

143
00:08:25.066 --> 00:08:26.766
- Pika, pika, pika.
- Hmm?

144
00:08:26.833 --> 00:08:31.533
It's picked up a signal! Onward! Go, Automatic Pikachu Retrieval Device!

145
00:08:31.599 --> 00:08:33.500
Pika! Pika! Pika!

146
00:08:33.566 --> 00:08:37.000
Begin retrieval! Let's go!

147
00:08:37.066 --> 00:08:40.233
- Ash! Wait up!
- Slow down! I'm coming!

148
00:08:40.299 --> 00:08:45.033
- Unh! Hey, what about me?
- Pika! Pika! Pika! Pika!

149
00:08:45.100 --> 00:08:48.866
Pika! Pika! Pika! Pika! Pika! Pika!

150
00:08:48.933 --> 00:08:51.400
-Hey, everyone!

151
00:08:51.466 --> 00:08:55.300
What's going on up ahead?

152
00:08:57.699 --> 00:08:59.866
I think it's stuck.

153
00:09:07.966 --> 00:09:10.733
Oops. Another failure.

154
00:09:10.800 --> 00:09:15.166
Failure is the mother of success! I so want to believe that.

155
00:09:19.266 --> 00:09:23.600
Okay, we're all set. Now, why don't we see how you work.

156
00:09:26.199 --> 00:09:28.600
That's odd. Perhaps a loose wire.

157
00:09:29.600 --> 00:09:33.266
That's the radio observatory we saw before.

158
00:09:33.333 --> 00:09:36.266
Look! Isn't that Officer Jenny's motorcycle?

159
00:09:36.333 --> 00:09:41.166
Huh? You're right. I wonder what she's doing here.

160
00:09:41.233 --> 00:09:44.733
You know, if that Pikabot of yours was on the right track,

161
00:09:44.800 --> 00:09:47.400
maybe this weird joint is Madame X's hideout.

162
00:09:47.466 --> 00:09:49.133
-Could be.

163
00:09:49.199 --> 00:09:52.866
Officer Jenny could have gotten a report and went to investigate.

164
00:09:52.933 --> 00:09:55.133
I'd say that the probability is quite high.

165
00:09:55.199 --> 00:09:58.433
- Okay! Let's go in!
- Right!

166
00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:10.800
Pika...

167
00:10:10.866 --> 00:10:16.033
Heh! Now you belong to me. Come, Pikachu!

168
00:10:18.433 --> 00:10:24.366
Ah. Good. I just know you'll work very hard for me.

169
00:10:24.433 --> 00:10:26.300
Pika.

170
00:10:26.366 --> 00:10:28.666
Madame X, we have intruders.

171
00:10:28.733 --> 00:10:34.100
So they've found my hideout. Those fools! They're going to pay for this!

172
00:10:34.166 --> 00:10:38.333
They have the Pokémon Chespin, Fennekin and Froakie with them.

173
00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:41.800
Perhaps you'd like to take them as servants, too.

174
00:10:42.800 --> 00:10:46.633
Yes, I would. They should all prove to be quite useful.

175
00:10:46.699 --> 00:10:48.566
Malamar.

176
00:10:52.666 --> 00:10:54.733
- We should split up.
- Right.

177
00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:57.833
- Bonnie, come with me!
- Okay, then we'll go down here!

178
00:10:59.333 --> 00:11:05.566
Officer Jenny, since we saw her motorcycle parked outside, she's got to be in here.

179
00:11:05.633 --> 00:11:07.833
Yeah, but where is she?

180
00:11:07.900 --> 00:11:11.300
- I wonder if Madame X got a hold of her.
- Na-na!

181
00:11:11.366 --> 00:11:13.633
- Huh?
- Malamar!

182
00:11:13.699 --> 00:11:15.833
Mala.

183
00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:18.366
Who's that Pokémon?

184
00:11:22.900 --> 00:11:25.366
It's Malamar!

185
00:11:30.166 --> 00:11:31.566
Malamar!

186
00:11:31.633 --> 00:11:33.800
So this is Madame X's hideout, isn't it?

187
00:11:33.866 --> 00:11:36.800
Malamar.

188
00:11:36.866 --> 00:11:39.800
Huh?

189
00:11:47.366 --> 00:11:48.466
Not in here.

190
00:11:48.533 --> 00:11:51.566
I wonder if Clemont found any sign of them.

191
00:11:52.766 --> 00:11:54.933
Negative.

192
00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:57.433
I haven't found a trace of them.

193
00:11:57.500 --> 00:12:01.500
Ash, Serena, let's all continue looking together.

194
00:12:01.566 --> 00:12:03.600
- Na-na.
- Clemont? Bonnie?

195
00:12:03.666 --> 00:12:06.600
Kind of, but they're being controlled now too!

196
00:12:06.666 --> 00:12:09.300
Malamar.

197
00:12:09.366 --> 00:12:12.966
- Malamar?
- Mal!

198
00:12:13.033 --> 00:12:16.133
- Don't look at it, twerps!
- Let's run!

199
00:12:18.100 --> 00:12:21.166
- Malamar!
- Oh, no. What are we going to do now?

200
00:12:21.233 --> 00:12:26.900
- I know! Use Fury Swipes on me, fast!
- Right!

201
00:12:26.966 --> 00:12:29.000
Now, me!

202
00:12:29.066 --> 00:12:32.199
- Ow, ow, ow!
- Man, does that hurt!

203
00:12:32.266 --> 00:12:35.566
- And I'm afraid your mug's up next!
- No! No!

204
00:12:35.633 --> 00:12:38.666
I don't want my face to end up all scratched like that!

205
00:12:38.733 --> 00:12:41.166
Malamar!

206
00:12:44.233 --> 00:12:46.599
- Serena!
- We're too late!

207
00:12:46.666 --> 00:12:51.033
- We got to scram out of here , quick!
- Sounds good, but how do we do that?

208
00:12:51.099 --> 00:12:52.766
Ah.

209
00:12:52.833 --> 00:12:55.000
Meowth, can you cut that thing loose?

210
00:12:55.066 --> 00:12:58.900
No problem!

211
00:13:00.233 --> 00:13:03.000
Great job, Meowth!

212
00:13:04.233 --> 00:13:06.400
Mala.

213
00:13:11.366 --> 00:13:15.466
Dig it, now maybe we'll finally get the chance to stomp all over Madame X's plans

214
00:13:15.533 --> 00:13:18.633
to take over the world and save our buddies at the same time!

215
00:13:18.699 --> 00:13:21.733
Got you! Hey, where are we?

216
00:13:21.800 --> 00:13:27.233
It's way too dark to know for sure, but I think we're inside the monitoring room!

217
00:13:27.300 --> 00:13:28.733
Huh?

218
00:13:28.800 --> 00:13:33.400
-You thought correctly.

219
00:13:33.466 --> 00:13:37.566
- Pikachu!
- Show them your power.

220
00:13:40.800 --> 00:13:44.066
Pikachu!

221
00:13:48.099 --> 00:13:51.233
Twerp, are you okay?

222
00:13:51.300 --> 00:13:53.800
Why would Pikachu attack me like that?

223
00:13:53.866 --> 00:13:57.966
Check out the eyes. Pikachu's been hypnotized by Malamar!

224
00:13:58.033 --> 00:14:00.699
- Pika!
- No way!

225
00:14:00.766 --> 00:14:04.466
Pikachu has become my faithful and obedient servant!

226
00:14:04.533 --> 00:14:06.866
Now, stop them once and for all!

227
00:14:06.933 --> 00:14:14.333
Pikachu! Argh!

228
00:14:14.400 --> 00:14:17.833
Magnificent! Continue your wonderful work.

229
00:14:17.900 --> 00:14:22.699
Pika. Pika. Pikachu. Pi!

230
00:14:22.766 --> 00:14:24.533
Argh!

231
00:14:24.599 --> 00:14:26.599
- Pikachu!
- Pika!

232
00:14:26.666 --> 00:14:31.333
Pikachu can't hear a word you say! Madame X has taken over Pikachu's noggin!

233
00:14:31.400 --> 00:14:36.400
I don't believe it! Pikachu's still my number-one partner!

234
00:14:36.466 --> 00:14:40.133
And my friend! I know you can hear me!

235
00:14:40.199 --> 00:14:42.666
Give it up, Ash.

236
00:14:42.733 --> 00:14:46.900
No matter how you fight, you cannot resist Madame X.

237
00:14:46.966 --> 00:14:52.766
The world now belongs to Madame X, with Pikachu and the Pokémon patrol.

238
00:15:02.633 --> 00:15:06.699
Pikachu, finish this.

239
00:15:06.766 --> 00:15:11.433
Pika. Pika. Pika. Pikachu. Pi!

240
00:15:14.366 --> 00:15:19.033
Chu!

241
00:15:19.099 --> 00:15:23.000
-Pika. Pika. Pika. Pika. Pika. Pika.

242
00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:30.666
Pikachu... My voice, can you hear it?

243
00:15:33.466 --> 00:15:36.166
Fight it! You can't give in to her!

244
00:15:36.233 --> 00:15:39.433
You fool, you cannot win.

245
00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:43.833
Pikachu, buddy. I believe in you.

246
00:15:43.900 --> 00:15:49.533
- We're a team!
- Pika. Pika.

247
00:15:49.599 --> 00:15:53.699
Huh? What are you doing? Continue to attack the boy!

248
00:15:53.766 --> 00:15:57.333
That's it, Pikachu! You can break free!

249
00:15:57.400 --> 00:15:59.199
Pi! Pi!

250
00:15:59.266 --> 00:16:03.766
Whatever bond may be left, I will soon break that connection forever!

251
00:16:03.833 --> 00:16:06.233
- Pikachu! Stop him!
- Malamar.

252
00:16:06.300 --> 00:16:12.233
Pika... Pika!

253
00:16:12.300 --> 00:16:14.133
Pika! Pika!

254
00:16:14.199 --> 00:16:18.133
- Pi! Pi!
- You can do it, Pikachu!

255
00:16:18.199 --> 00:16:23.133
Pikachu! Pi! Pi!

256
00:16:23.199 --> 00:16:25.599
- Pika!
- Huh?

257
00:16:25.666 --> 00:16:28.599
- Pika! Pika! Pika! Pika!
- Pika!

258
00:16:28.666 --> 00:16:33.800
- Look out!
- Pika! Pika! Pika! Pika! Pika! Pika! Pika!

259
00:16:47.099 --> 00:16:48.166
Huh?

260
00:16:52.566 --> 00:16:55.566
Huh?

261
00:16:55.633 --> 00:16:58.766
- Pika. Pika. Pi!
- Pikachu!

262
00:16:58.833 --> 00:17:00.966
Yeah! Yes! Yes!

263
00:17:01.033 --> 00:17:02.866
Why are we here?

264
00:17:02.933 --> 00:17:05.233
Most likely to figure out where we are.

265
00:17:05.300 --> 00:17:09.366
- Wobbu?
- You're you again! Big improvement!

266
00:17:09.433 --> 00:17:13.266
Uh, so who can tell me what Serena's doing over here?

267
00:17:13.333 --> 00:17:17.366
Uh, I guess Malamar was controlling me as well!

268
00:17:17.433 --> 00:17:20.566
- Look! There's Madame X!
- Huh?

269
00:17:28.733 --> 00:17:30.366
- Huh?
- Huh?

270
00:17:30.433 --> 00:17:34.500
- Officer Jenny!
- What am I doing?

271
00:17:34.566 --> 00:17:37.366
I got a report that strange things were going on here

272
00:17:37.433 --> 00:17:43.300
and hurried over right away, then I ran into that Malamar!

273
00:17:45.366 --> 00:17:50.066
Malamar!

274
00:17:50.133 --> 00:17:53.500
Hey! Malamar's saying it's really grateful to Officer Jenny

275
00:17:53.566 --> 00:17:55.600
for doing all of its work for it!

276
00:17:55.666 --> 00:17:57.166
What's going on?

277
00:17:57.233 --> 00:18:00.666
Of course! Malamar must've hypnotized Officer Jenny,

278
00:18:00.733 --> 00:18:03.033
so she could then assume the role of Madame X!

279
00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:05.000
Malamar!

280
00:18:05.066 --> 00:18:09.033
Malamar says that's how it was able to start working on an important new weapon!

281
00:18:09.100 --> 00:18:10.966
New weapon?

282
00:18:11.033 --> 00:18:13.733
- And what are you going to do with it?
- Pika.

283
00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:15.633
Malamar.

284
00:18:15.700 --> 00:18:17.166
Take over the world!

285
00:18:17.233 --> 00:18:20.733
Then that means, we'll be doing all the work for Malamar like before!

286
00:18:20.800 --> 00:18:24.233
Oh? In your dreams! Inkay, Psybeam!

287
00:18:24.300 --> 00:18:26.899
Pikachu, Thunderbolt, let's go!

288
00:18:26.966 --> 00:18:31.366
- Inkay!
- Pikachu!

289
00:18:34.200 --> 00:18:38.899
Malamar! Malamar! Ma!

290
00:18:38.966 --> 00:18:41.666
- It's fleeing!
- Come back and fight, you coward!

291
00:18:41.733 --> 00:18:44.200
- We'll get it!
- Pika!

292
00:18:48.766 --> 00:18:50.433
- Oh!
- Pika?

293
00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:02.000
- What's that?
- The new weapon.

294
00:19:02.066 --> 00:19:03.566
This is it.

295
00:19:03.633 --> 00:19:05.500
Malamar.

296
00:19:05.566 --> 00:19:08.433
That's right. This is how the new world starts

297
00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:12.000
and that will only be the beginning of its evil grand design!

298
00:19:12.066 --> 00:19:13.500
Malamar!

299
00:19:13.566 --> 00:19:19.033
But now that it's been discovered, it has to destroy the weapon right away!

300
00:19:23.800 --> 00:19:25.800
Malamar!

301
00:19:26.800 --> 00:19:30.466
- Malamar, stop!
- You've got to run! It's going to blow!

302
00:19:44.966 --> 00:19:48.466
- Mala!
- Look! It's Malamar!

303
00:19:49.700 --> 00:19:55.333
The beginning of its evil grand design, those words came from Malamar.

304
00:19:55.399 --> 00:19:58.399
What does it mean? What happens next?

305
00:19:58.466 --> 00:20:01.466
Well, there are still a lot of questions left unanswered.

306
00:20:01.533 --> 00:20:05.566
Malamar, that's one scary Pokémon.

307
00:20:05.633 --> 00:20:06.966
Pika.

308
00:20:07.966 --> 00:20:10.433
Our heroes and Officer Jenny are left wondering

309
00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:13.033
what Malamar's master plan could be,

310
00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:19.966
but Ash's Cyllage City Gym battle still lies ahead as the journey continues!

311
00:20:21.933 --> 00:20:27.600
Being controlled by Malamar like a bunch of robots, how pathetic can we get?

312
00:20:27.666 --> 00:20:28.966
Wobbuffet.

313
00:20:29.033 --> 00:20:31.733
Huh? Hold the phone.

314
00:20:31.800 --> 00:20:34.633
Malamar's the evolved form of Inkay, right?

315
00:20:34.700 --> 00:20:37.833
- Inkay?
- Huh?

316
00:20:41.133 --> 00:20:42.433
Inkay!

317
00:20:45.899 --> 00:20:47.899
Stay tuned!
